          "goto": "dlg_haydee_story_spared_her",
          "id": "dlg_haydee_story_spare",
          "text": "She has carried it long enough. Do not ask tonight."
        }
      ],
      "id": "dlg_haydee_story_open",
      "text": "Yes; a pallor that suits you admirably, mother, but which did not the less alarm my father and myself."
